  "name": "Bambinos - Renewal payment to scheduled classes (zero-touch + exceptions)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bambinos renewal automation (template)\n**Trigger A:** payment webhook (Razorpay/Stripe). **Trigger B:** 15-minute reconciliation sweep.\nBoth feed the SAME rules engine (Code node = n8n_rules_engine.js, mirrors reconcile.py and the Google Sheet).\n**Zero-touch** -> create booking + WhatsApp confirmation. **SOFT / HUMAN / BLOCK** -> LLM drafts the message -> one named owner.\nReplace every REPLACE_* value and connect credentials before activating. Run in SHADOW MODE first (log only).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
